{"seq":2,"slug":"testing-debugging","title":"测试与调试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/dart-language-async/ecosystem/testing-debugging","wordCount":943,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"测试与调试\">测试与调试</h1><p>Dart 内置的 <code>package:test</code> 框架和 DevTools 调试工具链覆盖了从单元测试到性能分析的完整质量保障流程。测试在 Dart 生态中不是可选附件——pub.dev 的评分系统将测试覆盖纳入包质量评估，社区标准要求库包必须有测试才能获得信任。本文深入测试框架的分组、匹配器、异步测试模式，以及 DevTools 的性能和内存分析能力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>先立起本篇的几张底牌，后文所有论证都围绕它们展开：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>一句话定义</th>\n<th>在本篇中的角色</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>group</code></td>\n<td>逻辑分组并共享 setUp/tearDown 的测试容器</td>\n<td>测试组织的基本单元</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>匹配器</td>\n<td><code>package:matcher</code> 提供的可组合断言</td>\n<td>把「期望」表达为可读对象</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>异步测试</td>\n<td>测试函数可直接是 async，Stream 有专属匹配器</td>\n<td>覆盖 Future/Stream 两类异步</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FakeAsync</td>\n<td>精确控制虚拟时间推进</td>\n<td>验证 debounce/throttle 等时序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Test Double</td>\n<td>Mock/Stub/Fake/Spy 四类替身的选用</td>\n<td>按「验证交互 or 隔离依赖」选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DevTools</td>\n<td>浏览器端 Debugger/Profiler/Memory/Network 套件</td>\n<td>从单测走向性能与泄漏分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>测试金字塔</td>\n<td>单元 70%、集成 20%、端到端 10%</td>\n<td>测试投资分配的经验法则</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话串起来：<code>group</code> 与匹配器决定如何写清一个断言，异步测试与 FakeAsync 覆盖随时间变化的行为，Test Double 决定依赖如何被替换，DevTools 与金字塔决定测试之外的质量保障投资。</p>\n<h2 id=\"测试框架架构\">测试框架架构</h2><p><code>package:test</code> 提供了结构化的测试组织方式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"import &#39;package:test/test.dart&#39;;&#10;&#10;void main() {&#10;  group(&#39;Calculator&#39;, () {&#10;    late Calculator calc;&#10;&#10;    setUp(() {&#10;      calc = Calculator(); // 每个测试前重新创建&#10;    });&#10;&#10;    tearDown(() {&#10;      calc.dispose(); // 每个测试后清理&#10;    });&#10;&#10;    test(&#39;addition returns correct sum&#39;, () {&#10;      expect(calc.add(2, 3), equals(5));&#10;    });&#10;&#10;    test(&#39;division throws on zero divisor&#39;, () {&#10;      expect(() =&gt; calc.divide(10, 0), throwsA(isA&lt;ArgumentError&gt;()));&#10;    });&#10;&#10;    group(&#39;negative numbers&#39;, () {&#10;      test(&#39;handles negative operands&#39;, () {&#10;        expect(calc.add(-1, -2), equals(-3));&#10;      });&#10;    });&#10;  });&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import 'package:test/test.dart';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>void main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  group('Calculator', () {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    late Calculator calc;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    setUp(() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      calc = Calculator(); // 每个测试前重新创建</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    tearDown(() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      calc.dispose(); // 每个测试后清理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    test('addition returns correct sum', () {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      expect(calc.add(2, 3), equals(5));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    test('division throws on zero divisor', () {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      expect(() => calc.divide(10, 0), throwsA(isA&#x3C;ArgumentError>()));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    group('negative numbers', () {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      test('handles negative operands', () {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        expect(calc.add(-1, -2), equals(-3));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>执行时机</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>group()</code></td>\n<td>逻辑分组，共享 setUp/tearDown</td>\n<td>声明时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>test()</code></td>\n<td>单个测试用例</td>\n<td>依次执行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>setUp()</code></td>\n<td>前置准备</td>\n<td>每个 test 之前</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>tearDown()</code></td>\n<td>后置清理</td>\n<td>每个 test 之后</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>setUpAll()</code></td>\n<td>全局准备</td>\n<td>group 内第一个 test 之前</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>tearDownAll()</code></td>\n<td>全局清理</td>\n<td>group 内最后一个 test 之后</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"匹配器系统\">匹配器系统</h2><p><code>package:matcher</code> 提供了丰富的断言匹配器，支持组合和自定义：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// 基础匹配器&#10;expect(value, equals(42));&#10;expect(value, isNull);&#10;expect(value, isNotEmpty);&#10;expect(value, isA&lt;String&gt;());&#10;&#10;// 数值匹配&#10;expect(3.14159, closeTo(3.14, 0.01));&#10;expect(value, greaterThan(0));&#10;expect(value, inInclusiveRange(1, 100));&#10;&#10;// 集合匹配&#10;expect(list, contains(42));&#10;expect(list, hasLength(3));&#10;expect(list, orderedEquals([1, 2, 3]));&#10;expect(map, containsPair(&#39;key&#39;, &#39;value&#39;));&#10;&#10;// 字符串匹配&#10;expect(str, startsWith(&#39;Hello&#39;));&#10;expect(str, matches(RegExp(r&#39;\\d+&#39;)));&#10;&#10;// 异常匹配&#10;expect(() =&gt; riskyCall(), throwsA(isA&lt;FormatException&gt;()&#10;    .having((e) =&gt; e.message, &#39;message&#39;, contains(&#39;invalid&#39;))));&#10;&#10;// 自定义匹配器&#10;Matcher isValidEmail = predicate&lt;String&gt;(&#10;  (s) =&gt; RegExp(r&#39;^[\\w-.]+@[\\w-]+\\.\\w+$&#39;).hasMatch(s),&#10;  &#39;is a valid email address&#39;,&#10;);&#10;expect(user.email, isValidEmail);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 基础匹配器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>expect(value, equals(42));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>expect(value, isNull);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>expect(value, isNotEmpty);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>expect(value, isA&#x3C;String>());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 数值匹配</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>expect(3.14159, closeTo(3.14, 0.01));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>expect(value, greaterThan(0));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>expect(value, inInclusiveRange(1, 100));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 集合匹配</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>expect(list, contains(42));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>expect(list, hasLength(3));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>expect(list, orderedEquals([1, 2, 3]));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>expect(map, containsPair('key', 'value'));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 字符串匹配</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>expect(str, startsWith('Hello'));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>expect(str, matches(RegExp(r'\\d+')));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 异常匹配</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>expect(() => riskyCall(), throwsA(isA&#x3C;FormatException>()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .having((e) => e.message, 'message', contains('invalid'))));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 自定义匹配器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Matcher isValidEmail = predicate&#x3C;String>(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (s) => RegExp(r'^[\\w-.]+@[\\w-]+\\.\\w+$').hasMatch(s),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  'is a valid email address',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>expect(user.email, isValidEmail);</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[expect 调用] --&gt; B[匹配器评估]&#10;    B --&gt;|匹配成功| C[测试继续]&#10;    B --&gt;|匹配失败| D[生成差异描述]&#10;    D --&gt; E[TestFailure 异常]&#10;    E --&gt; F[测试标记失败]\">graph TD\n    A[expect 调用] --&gt; B[匹配器评估]\n    B --&gt;|匹配成功| C[测试继续]\n    B --&gt;|匹配失败| D[生成差异描述]\n    D --&gt; E[TestFailure 异常]\n    E --&gt; F[测试标记失败]</pre><h2 id=\"异步测试模式\">异步测试模式</h2><p>Dart 的 async/await 与测试框架无缝集成——测试函数可以直接是 async：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"test(&#39;fetches user data&#39;, () async {&#10;  final user = await userRepository.findById(&#39;user-123&#39;);&#10;  expect(user, isNotNull);&#10;  expect(user!.name, equals(&#39;Alice&#39;));&#10;});&#10;&#10;// Stream 测试&#10;test(&#39;emits values in order&#39;, () {&#10;  final stream = counterStream(3);&#10;  expect(stream, emitsInOrder([1, 2, 3, emitsDone]));&#10;});&#10;&#10;test(&#39;emits error on invalid input&#39;, () {&#10;  final stream = processStream(invalidData);&#10;  expect(stream, emitsError(isA&lt;FormatException&gt;()));&#10;});&#10;&#10;// 超时控制&#10;test(&#39;completes within time limit&#39;, () async {&#10;  final result = await fetchWithRetry(url);&#10;  expect(result.statusCode, equals(200));&#10;}, timeout: Timeout(Duration(seconds: 10)));&#10;&#10;// FakeAsync：精确控制时间&#10;test(&#39;debounce waits before emitting&#39;, () {&#10;  fakeAsync((async) {&#10;    final controller = StreamController&lt;String&gt;();&#10;    final debounced = controller.stream.debounce(Duration(seconds: 1));&#10;    final values = &lt;String&gt;[];&#10;    debounced.listen(values.add);&#10;&#10;    controller.add(&#39;first&#39;);&#10;    async.elapse(Duration(milliseconds: 500));&#10;    expect(values, isEmpty); // 未到 1 秒，不发射&#10;&#10;    async.elapse(Duration(milliseconds: 600));&#10;    expect(values, [&#39;first&#39;]); // 超过 1 秒，发射&#10;  });&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>test('fetches user data', () async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final user = await userRepository.findById('user-123');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  expect(user, isNotNull);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  expect(user!.name, equals('Alice'));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// Stream 测试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>test('emits values in order', () {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final stream = counterStream(3);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  expect(stream, emitsInOrder([1, 2, 3, emitsDone]));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>test('emits error on invalid input', () {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final stream = processStream(invalidData);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  expect(stream, emitsError(isA&#x3C;FormatException>()));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 超时控制</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>test('completes within time limit', () async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final result = await fetchWithRetry(url);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  expect(result.statusCode, equals(200));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}, timeout: Timeout(Duration(seconds: 10)));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// FakeAsync：精确控制时间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>test('debounce waits before emitting', () {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  fakeAsync((async) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    final controller = StreamController&#x3C;String>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    final debounced = controller.stream.debounce(Duration(seconds: 1));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    final values = &#x3C;String>[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    debounced.listen(values.add);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    controller.add('first');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    async.elapse(Duration(milliseconds: 500));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    expect(values, isEmpty); // 未到 1 秒，不发射</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    async.elapse(Duration(milliseconds: 600));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    expect(values, ['first']); // 超过 1 秒，发射</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"mock-与依赖注入\">Mock 与依赖注入</h2><p><code>package:mockito</code> 配合代码生成提供类型安全的 mock：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"import &#39;package:mockito/annotations.dart&#39;;&#10;import &#39;package:mockito/mockito.dart&#39;;&#10;&#10;@GenerateMocks([HttpClient, Database])&#10;import &#39;user_service_test.mocks.dart&#39;;&#10;&#10;void main() {&#10;  late MockHttpClient mockHttp;&#10;  late MockDatabase mockDb;&#10;  late UserService service;&#10;&#10;  setUp(() {&#10;    mockHttp = MockHttpClient();&#10;    mockDb = MockDatabase();&#10;    service = UserService(http: mockHttp, db: mockDb);&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  test(&#39;creates user and stores in database&#39;, () async {&#10;    // Arrange&#10;    when(mockHttp.post(any, body: anyNamed(&#39;body&#39;)))&#10;        .thenAnswer((_) async =&gt; Response(&#39;{&quot;id&quot;: &quot;123&quot;}&#39;, 201));&#10;    when(mockDb.insert(any))&#10;        .thenAnswer((_) async =&gt; true);&#10;&#10;    // Act&#10;    final user = await service.createUser(&#39;Alice&#39;, &#39;alice@test.com&#39;);&#10;&#10;    // Assert&#10;    expect(user.id, equals(&#39;123&#39;));&#10;    verify(mockDb.insert(argThat(&#10;      predicate&lt;User&gt;((u) =&gt; u.name == &#39;Alice&#39;),&#10;    ))).called(1);&#10;    verifyNoMoreInteractions(mockDb);&#10;  });&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import 'package:mockito/annotations.dart';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import 'package:mockito/mockito.dart';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@GenerateMocks([HttpClient, Database])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import 'user_service_test.mocks.dart';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>void main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  late MockHttpClient mockHttp;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  late MockDatabase mockDb;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  late UserService service;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  setUp(() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    mockHttp = MockHttpClient();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    mockDb = MockDatabase();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    service = UserService(http: mockHttp, db: mockDb);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  test('creates user and stores in database', () async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // Arrange</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    when(mockHttp.post(any, body: anyNamed('body')))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .thenAnswer((_) async => Response('{\"id\": \"123\"}', 201));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    when(mockDb.insert(any))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .thenAnswer((_) async => true);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // Act</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    final user = await service.createUser('Alice', 'alice@test.com');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // Assert</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    expect(user.id, equals('123'));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    verify(mockDb.insert(argThat(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      predicate&#x3C;User>((u) => u.name == 'Alice'),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ))).called(1);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    verifyNoMoreInteractions(mockDb);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>测试替身（Test Double）的选择标准：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>推荐场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Mock</td>\n<td>验证交互（方法被调用）</td>\n<td>验证副作用（发消息、写数据库）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Stub</td>\n<td>返回预设值</td>\n<td>隔离外部依赖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fake</td>\n<td>简化的真实实现</td>\n<td>内存数据库、本地文件系统</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Spy</td>\n<td>包装真实对象，记录调用</td>\n<td>验证集成行为</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"测试运行与配置\">测试运行与配置</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 运行所有测试&#10;dart test&#10;&#10;# 运行特定文件&#10;dart test test/unit/calculator_test.dart&#10;&#10;# 按名称过滤&#10;dart test --name &quot;addition&quot;&#10;&#10;# 并发运行（利用多核）&#10;dart test --concurrency=4&#10;&#10;# 生成覆盖率报告&#10;dart test --coverage=coverage&#10;dart run coverage:format_coverage \\&#10;  --lcov --in=coverage --out=coverage/lcov.info\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 运行所有测试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dart</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 运行特定文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dart</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test/unit/calculator_test.dart</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 按名称过滤</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dart</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --name</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"addition\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 并发运行（利用多核）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dart</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --concurrency=4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 生成覆盖率报告</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dart</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --coverage=coverage</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dart</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> coverage:format_coverage</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --lcov</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --in=coverage</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --out=coverage/lcov.info</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>dart_test.yaml</code> 配置全局测试行为：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# dart_test.yaml&#10;timeout: 30s&#10;platforms: [vm, chrome] # 在 VM 和浏览器中都运行&#10;retry: 2 # 失败重试次数&#10;&#10;tags:&#10;  integration:&#10;    timeout: 2m # 集成测试更长超时&#10;  slow:&#10;    skip: &#39;Too slow for CI&#39;&#10;&#10;override_platforms:&#10;  chrome:&#10;    settings:&#10;      headless: true\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># dart_test.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">timeout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">30s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">platforms</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">vm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">chrome</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 在 VM 和浏览器中都运行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">retry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 失败重试次数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">tags</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  integration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    timeout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">2m</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 集成测试更长超时</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  slow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    skip</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Too slow for CI'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">override_platforms</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  chrome</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    settings</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      headless</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"devtools-调试\">DevTools 调试</h2><p>Dart DevTools 是一套浏览器端的调试和性能分析工具：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[Dart DevTools] --&gt; B[Debugger]&#10;    A --&gt; C[CPU Profiler]&#10;    A --&gt; D[Memory]&#10;    A --&gt; E[Network]&#10;    A --&gt; F[Logging]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[断点 / 单步]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[变量检查]&#10;    B --&gt; B3[调用栈]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[火焰图]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[自顶向下 / 自底向上]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[堆快照]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[分配追踪]&#10;    D --&gt; D3[泄漏检测]\">graph LR\n    A[Dart DevTools] --&gt; B[Debugger]\n    A --&gt; C[CPU Profiler]\n    A --&gt; D[Memory]\n    A --&gt; E[Network]\n    A --&gt; F[Logging]\n    B --&gt; B1[断点 / 单步]\n    B --&gt; B2[变量检查]\n    B --&gt; B3[调用栈]\n    C --&gt; C1[火焰图]\n    C --&gt; C2[自顶向下 / 自底向上]\n    D --&gt; D1[堆快照]\n    D --&gt; D2[分配追踪]\n    D --&gt; D3[泄漏检测]</pre><p>关键调试技巧：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// 条件断点（在 IDE 中设置）&#10;// 当 i &gt; 1000 时才暂停&#10;&#10;// 日志断点（不暂停，只打印）&#10;// 在 DevTools Console 中查看&#10;&#10;// Observatory（低级 VM 调试）&#10;// dart run --observe=8181 main.dart&#10;&#10;// 性能标记&#10;import &#39;dart:developer&#39;;&#10;Timeline.startSync(&#39;parseJson&#39;);&#10;final result = jsonDecode(largeString);&#10;Timeline.finishSync();&#10;&#10;// 调试打印（带结构化输出）&#10;debugger(when: condition, message: &#39;Unexpected state&#39;);&#10;log(&#39;Processing item $id&#39;, name: &#39;MyApp.processor&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 条件断点（在 IDE 中设置）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 当 i > 1000 时才暂停</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 日志断点（不暂停，只打印）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 在 DevTools Console 中查看</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// Observatory（低级 VM 调试）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// dart run --observe=8181 main.dart</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 性能标记</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import 'dart:developer';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Timeline.startSync('parseJson');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final result = jsonDecode(largeString);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Timeline.finishSync();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 调试打印（带结构化输出）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>debugger(when: condition, message: 'Unexpected state');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>log('Processing item $id', name: 'MyApp.processor');</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"测试金字塔实践\">测试金字塔实践</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// 单元测试（快速、隔离、大量）&#10;test(&#39;validates email format&#39;, () {&#10;  expect(isValidEmail(&#39;user@example.com&#39;), isTrue);&#10;  expect(isValidEmail(&#39;invalid&#39;), isFalse);&#10;});&#10;&#10;// 集成测试（中速、验证组件交互）&#10;test(&#39;repository saves and retrieves user&#39;, () async {&#10;  final db = InMemoryDatabase();&#10;  final repo = UserRepository(db);&#10;  await repo.save(User(id: &#39;1&#39;, name: &#39;Test&#39;));&#10;  final found = await repo.findById(&#39;1&#39;);&#10;  expect(found?.name, equals(&#39;Test&#39;));&#10;});&#10;&#10;// 端到端测试（慢、验证完整流程）&#10;test(&#39;user registration flow&#39;, () async {&#10;  final server = await startTestServer();&#10;  final client = HttpClient();&#10;  final response = await client.post(&#10;    &#39;${server.url}/register&#39;,&#10;    body: {&#39;email&#39;: &#39;new@test.com&#39;, &#39;password&#39;: &#39;secure123&#39;},&#10;  );&#10;  expect(response.statusCode, equals(201));&#10;  await server.close();&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 单元测试（快速、隔离、大量）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>test('validates email format', () {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  expect(isValidEmail('user@example.com'), isTrue);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  expect(isValidEmail('invalid'), isFalse);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 集成测试（中速、验证组件交互）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>test('repository saves and retrieves user', () async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final db = InMemoryDatabase();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final repo = UserRepository(db);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  await repo.save(User(id: '1', name: 'Test'));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final found = await repo.findById('1');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  expect(found?.name, equals('Test'));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 端到端测试（慢、验证完整流程）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>test('user registration flow', () async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final server = await startTestServer();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final client = HttpClient();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final response = await client.post(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    '${server.url}/register',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    body: {'email': 'new@test.com', 'password': 'secure123'},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  expect(response.statusCode, equals(201));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  await server.close();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><p>测试比例的经验法则：单元测试 70%、集成测试 20%、端到端测试 10%。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><code>package:test</code> 用 <code>group</code>/<code>test</code>/<code>setUp</code>/<code>tearDown</code> 组织用例，<code>setUpAll</code>/<code>tearDownAll</code> 负责 group 级别的准备与清理。</li>\n<li><code>package:matcher</code> 的匹配器可组合、可自定义，异常断言用 <code>throwsA(...having(...))</code> 精确定位字段。</li>\n<li>异步测试与 async/await 无缝集成：测试函数可直接 async，Stream 用 <code>emitsInOrder</code>/<code>emitsError</code>，时序行为用 <code>FakeAsync.elapse</code> 精确控制。</li>\n<li>Mock/Stub/Fake/Spy 四类替身按目的选：验证交互用 Mock、隔离依赖用 Stub、简化真实实现用 Fake、包装真实对象用 Spy。</li>\n<li><code>dart test</code> 支持按文件、按名称、并发与覆盖率运行，<code>dart_test.yaml</code> 配置超时、平台、重试与 tag 行为。</li>\n<li>DevTools 提供 Debugger、CPU Profiler、Memory、Network 全套分析能力，配合 <code>Timeline</code> 标记与结构化 <code>log</code> 定位性能与泄漏问题。</li>\n<li>测试投资遵循金字塔比例：单元 70%、集成 20%、端到端 10%。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>参阅 <a href=\"package-management-pub\">Pub 包管理与发布</a> 了解如何配置测试依赖和 CI 集成，以及 <a href=\"dart-server-backend\">Dart 服务端开发</a> 了解服务端应用的集成测试策略。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"测试与调试","id":"测试与调试"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"测试框架架构","id":"测试框架架构"},{"level":2,"text":"匹配器系统","id":"匹配器系统"},{"level":2,"text":"异步测试模式","id":"异步测试模式"},{"level":2,"text":"Mock 与依赖注入","id":"mock-与依赖注入"},{"level":2,"text":"测试运行与配置","id":"测试运行与配置"},{"level":2,"text":"DevTools 调试","id":"devtools-调试"},{"level":2,"text":"测试金字塔实践","id":"测试金字塔实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Pub 包管理与发布","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/dart-language-async/ecosystem/package-management-pub"},"next":{"title":"Dart 服务端开发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/dart-language-async/ecosystem/dart-server-backend"}}